alse\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"iconf-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-header__search js-header__search\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-header__search-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<form action=\"/search/\" method=\"GET\" role=\"search\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-header__search-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"search\" name=\"q\" id=\"search-field\" class=\"c-header__search-input js-header__search-input ss360-search-input\" placeholder=\"keyword\" aria-label=\"Search\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"c-header__search-btn ss360-search-button t-link iconf-search\" aria-label=\"Search\"></button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"c-header__mobile-button c-header__nav-toggle js-header__nav-toggle\" title=\"Open menu\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-alt-title=\"Close Menu\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b>\n\t\t\t\t\t<b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b>\n\t\t\t\t\t<b aria-hidden=\"true\"></b>\n\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"c-header__spacer\"></div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n<div class=\"c-hero c-hero--standard c-hero--has-image\">\n    <div class=\"c-hero__primary\">\n        <div class=\"c-hero__body t-bg t-bg__text t-link-parent--plain\">\n            <div class=\"c-hero__body-content\">\n                <h1 class=\"c-hero__title\">Southern Response</h1>\n\n                        <div class=\"c-hero__text\">\n                            <p>Southern Response is the government-owned company set up to settle claims by AMI policyholders for Canterbury earthquake damage which occurred before 5 April 2012 (the date AMI was sold to IAG).</p>\n<p>The ongoing series of earthquakes since September 2010 had a profound impact on AMI and its Canterbury customers. As a result of the unprecedented cost of earthquake claims, in April 2011, AMI received capital support from the New Zealand government to ensure the interests of all AMI policyholders were protected and all claims would continue to be met under the terms of their policies.</p>\n<p>At the end of 2019, Southern Response had settled over 48,000 earthquake claims, and the remaining claims are being handled by the Natural Hazards Commission (formerly EQC) acting as Southern Response's agent since 2020.</p>\n                        </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"c-hero__figure\">\n                \n<span class=\"o-fit c-hero__image image-8da509eb-8bc0-4643-846f-d392cba31b88\">\n\t<picture>\n\t\t<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=200&height=150&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 200w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=400&height=300&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 400w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=600&height=449&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 600w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=800&height=600&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 800w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1000&height=750&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 1000w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1200&height=899&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 1200w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1400&height=1050&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 1400w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1600&height=1200&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 1600w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1800&height=1350&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 1800w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=2000&height=1500&v=1dae136996d1f40&format=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1320px) 1320px,100vw\" />\n\t\t<source srcset=\"/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=200&height=150&v=1dae136996d1f40 200w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=400&height=300&v=1dae136996d1f40 400w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=600&height=449&v=1dae136996d1f40 600w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=800&height=600&v=1dae136996d1f40 800w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1000&height=750&v=1dae136996d1f40 1000w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1200&height=899&v=1dae136996d1f40 1200w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1400&height=1050&v=1dae136996d1f40 1400w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1600&height=1200&v=1dae136996d1f40 1600w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=1800&height=1350&v=1dae136996d1f40 1800w,/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=2000&height=1500&v=1dae136996d1f40 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1320px) 1320px,100vw\" />\n\t\t<img src=\"/media/hstizh3j/sr-website-landing-page_about.jpg?rxy=0.6659091977226137,0.499958552658847&width=440&height=330&v=1dae136996d1f40\" alt=\"\" class=\"o-fit__image\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</picture>\n\t<style nonce=\"20yhl8Tm0IEeSNPMVSG&#x2B;NQ==\">\n\t\t.image-8da509eb-8bc0-4643-846f-d392cba31b88 {\n\t\t\tpadding-bottom: 75.00%;\n\t\t\tbackground-color: #859D93;\n\t\t}\n\t</style>\n</span>\n\n            </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<main role=\"main\">\n    <article class=\"o-layout-main\">\n            \n<section class=\"c-cta\">\n    <div class=\"c-cta__layout\">\n        <div class=\"c-cta__body\">\n            <div class=\"c-cta__body-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"c-cta__heading\">Payment Package</h3>\n                    <p class=\"c-cta__text\">In December 2020 the Government announced a payment package for affected customers who cash settled with Southern Response prior to 1 October 2014.</p>\n            </div>\n                <a class=\"c-cta__link o-button o-button--primary\" href=\"/payment-package/\">\n                    Payment Package\n                </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"c-two-column\">\n\t<div class=\"c-two-column__layout-wrapper\">\n\t\t<div class=\"c-two-column__layout\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-two-column__column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<section class=\"c-rte\">\n\t<div class=\"c-rte__layout\">\n\t\t<div class=\"c-rte__alignment--inset\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"t-link-parent c-rte__body-text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Our People</h2>\n<p>Southern Response is a Crown-owned company with a Board of Directors appointed by the Crown as sole shareholder.</p>\n<p>Learn more about our Board and Chief Executive&nbsp;<a href=\"/our-people/\" title=\"Our People\">here</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-two-column__column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<section class=\"c-rte\">\n\t<div class=\"c-rte__layout\">\n\t\t<div class=\"c-rte__alignment--inset\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"t-link-parent c-rte__body-text\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Contact Us</h2>\n<p>Office: 53 Princess Street, Riccarton, Christchurch. Phone 0800&nbsp;501 525</p>\n<p>Postal: PO Box 9052, Tower Junction, Christchurch 8149</p>\n<p>For claims-related queries please contact the <a href=\"https://naturalhazards.govt.nz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Natural Hazards Commission</a></p